proposal = "In BlockScoutWeb.Controller.full_path, compare a normalized URI path prefix on segment boundaries, preserve query encoding and join exactly one mount prefix. Cover nested paths, query occurrences, similarly named prefixes and trailing slashes through a real mounted endpoint redirect."
