observed = "The simulate section describes lxp_daemon_lni_simulate and hosted /v1/programs/call and /simulate over LNI, with sources under cmd/layerxd. The guide also recommends lx_sendActivity and describes CALL settlement in batch-finality terms (site404 onward, wiki445 onward), presenting pre-merge execution as current integration behavior."
