proposal = "Rewrite the integration portions of the Programs guide around native EVM deployment/call/simulation through the Programs precompile and node root RPC. State commit finality and the guest build/ABI/payload constraints; retain useful frozen ABI details only where they match current host code and label historical daemon protocols."
owner_domain = 13

